message: 'To cite package "lindol" in publications use:'
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
title: 'lindol: An Interface to the PHIVOLCS Earthquake Bulletins'
version: 0.0.0.9001
identifiers:
- type: url
  value: http://panukatan.io/lindol/
abstract: The Philippine Institute of Volcanology and Seismology (PHIVOLCS) maintains
  the National Earthquake Monitoring and Information which aims to provide accurate
  and timely information on significant earthquakes and tsunami events that may significantly
  impact the Philippines and ensures the accessibility and integrity of earthquake
  data. This package provides an interface to this information with functions that
  harvests, processes, and structures information from the frequent earthquake bulletins
  released by PHIVOLCS into machine-readable versions.
